      "reasoning": "FIRST directly examines the apparent paradox, distinguishing innate capacity, early exposure, and implicit memory from an existing memory of a specific language. SECOND substitutes the different question of language processing before speaking; its brief discussion of memory does not explain having language memory before learning language.",
